### 1. E2E Health Check (Public)
# Verifies database connection and JPA auditing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Actuator Health (Public)
# Returns liveness, readiness, and basic component checks
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. OpenAPI Specifications JSON (Public)
# Exposes the OpenAPI v3 spec models
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Country
# Creates United States in geography hierarchy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/geography/countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "United States",
  "iso_code": "USA"
}

### 5. Create State
# Creates California state linked to country
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/geography/states
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country_id": "PASTE_COUNTRY_ID_HERE",
  "name": "California",
  "code": "CA"
}

### 6. Create City
# Creates San Francisco city linked to state
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/geography/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state_id": "PASTE_STATE_ID_HERE",
  "name": "San Francisco"
}

### 7. Create Fire Station
# Creates physical fire station core connector
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": "PASTE_CITY_ID_HERE",
  "name": "SFFD Station 1",
  "address": "251 Lafayette St, San Francisco",
  "latitude": 37.774900,
  "longitude": -122.419400
}

### 8. Register Citizen (Onboarding)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "citizen_jane",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "phone_number": "+15550199",
  "role_names": ["ROLE_CITIZEN"]
}

### 9. Register Firefighter (Employee Onboarding)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "firefighter_bob",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "first_name": "Bob",
  "last_name": "Builder",
  "phone_number": "+15550299",
  "role_names": ["ROLE_FIREFIGHTER"],
  "station_id": "PASTE_STATION_ID_HERE",
  "employee_code": "EMP-99881"
}

### 10. Login (Authentication - returns JWT)
# Exposes token to be pasted as Bearer authorization below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "firefighter_bob",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 11. Shift Check-in (Firefighter authorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shifts/check-in
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "PASTE_EMPLOYEE_ID_HERE",
  "station_id": "PASTE_STATION_ID_HERE",
  "check_in_latitude": 37.774900,
  "check_in_longitude": -122.419400
}

### 12. Shift Check-out (Firefighter authorized - within 500m geofence)
# Expects shift status: COMPLETED
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shifts/check-out
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shift_id": "PASTE_SHIFT_ID_HERE",
  "check_out_latitude": 37.775600,
  "check_out_longitude": -122.419400
}

### 13. Submit Complaint (Citizen role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/complaints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reporterId": "PASTE_CITIZEN_ID_HERE",
  "categoryId": "PASTE_CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "latitude": 37.774900,
  "longitude": -122.419400,
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "description": "Structure fire reported near Lafeyette Street."
}

### 14. Escalate to Incident (Admin role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complaintId": "PASTE_COMPLAINT_ID_HERE",
  "stationId": "PASTE_STATION_ID_HERE",
  "categoryId": "PASTE_CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "latitude": 37.774900,
  "longitude": -122.419400,
  "notes": "Escalated by station dispatcher."
}

### 15. Update Incident Status to RESOLVED (Firefighter/Admin role)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents/PASTE_INCIDENT_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "notes": "Fire extinguished successfully. Scene cleared."
}
